From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:47:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: show Sparkle's update status on the About page

The About page reported "error code 0" from Chromium's updater stub. It now
asks Sparkle quietly whether a newer build is published and says "Shiny is
up to date", or "Shiny X is available." and opens Sparkle's install window.
Builds without Sparkle hide the status line.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
